👑🧠 Birbal and the Half Reward (Raw Story)

One day, a poor man came to Emperor Akbar.

He said, “I stood all night in a cold pond to win a reward.”

Akbar asked, “Did you get any help to stay warm?”

The man replied, “I saw a small lamp far away.”

Akbar said, “Then you got warmth from the lamp. You do not deserve the reward.”

The poor man felt sad and left.

Birbal heard about this.

The next day, Birbal was cooking food.

But he placed the pot very high above the fire.

Akbar saw this and laughed, “How will the food cook from so far?”

Birbal smiled and said, “If a lamp far away can give warmth, then this fire can cook the food too!”

Akbar understood his mistake.

He called the poor man and gave him the full reward.

💖 Moral:

Be fair and think before making decisions.
